                                <div class="accordion__quest-main" tabindex="0">
                                    <p>
                                        How do I clean my Gillette razor?
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion__content">
                                    <p>Here are some simple tips to keep your razor in great condition:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Rinse it well: While shaving, remember to rinse your razor frequently. Avoid tapping razor on the sink instead give it a swirl in warm water or run it under the tap. This will help remove hair and debris.</li>
                                        <li>Air dry: After rinsing, shake off any excess water and let the razor air dry. Avoid using a towel to pat the blades, as this can cause damage. Allowing it to air dry will help maintain its quality.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Proper storage: To keep your razor in top shape and prevent rust, store it in a dry area using its holder if you have one. It's a good idea to keep it away from bathroom products like cleaning sprays. If you don't have a holder, you can store the razor face-up on a surface or vertically in a cup or stand.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <p>By following these simple steps, you can extend the life of your razor and ensure a clean and comfortable shave every time!</p>
