me\":\"Round 2 — Shanghai, China\",\"title\":\"Firmly in the Fight\",\"body\":\"One place from back-to-back points. Hulkenberg finished P11 after a gritty drive through the field — a wheelgun issue at his pit stop the only thing separating him from a deserved reward. The weekend's standout moment came from Emma Felbermayr, who stormed to a commanding F1 Academy feature-race victory — the first win for Audi in the series.\",\"blockQuote\":\"The feeling with the car has been good. We look to be right in the midfield fight, which is encouraging. It's very tight out there.\",\"blockQuoteCite\":\"Nico Hulkenberg\",\"galleryImages\":[{\"src\":{\"production\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-dukhrgn8mp/images/stencil/original/content/audi-f1/season-journey/shanghai/shanghai1.jpg\",\"staging\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-h1praqx0uf/images/stencil/original/content/audi-f1/season-journey/shanghai/shanghai1.jpg\"},\"alt\":\"Audi Revolut F1 car battling side-by-side with Alpine at the 2026 Chinese Grand Prix\"},{\"src\":{\"production\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-dukhrgn8mp/images/stencil/original/content/audi-f1/season-journey/shanghai/shanghai2.jpg\",\"staging\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-h1praqx0uf/images/stencil/original/content/audi-f1/season-journey/shanghai/shanghai2.jpg\"},\"alt\":\"Nico Hulkenberg leading the pack in dramatic conditions at Shanghai\"},{\"src\":{\"production\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-dukhrgn8mp/images/stencil/original/content/audi-f1/season-journey/shanghai/shanghai3.jpg\",\"staging\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-h1praqx0uf/images/stencil/original/content/audi-f1/season-journey/shanghai/shanghai3.jpg\"},\"alt\":\"Hulkenberg car 27 at high speed with motion blur during Friday practice in Shanghai\"},{\"src\":{\"production\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-dukhrgn8mp/images/stencil/original/content/audi-f1/season-journey/shanghai/shanghai4.jpg\",\"staging\":\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-h1praqx0uf/images/stencil/or